e:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx)\\n   - Text Source: [Set_B_Question_Paper.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.txt)\\n\\n4. **Set B Marking Scheme & Step-by-Step Solutions**\\n   - Word Document: [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx)\\n   - Text Source: [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.txt)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Embedded High-Contrast Diagrams\\n\\n| Question | Diagram Included | Set A | Set B |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| **Q19 (AR)** | Visual graph showing continuity vs differentiability | $y = \\\\|x - 2\\\\|$ corner point | $y = [x]$ step discontinuitie\n<truncated 1710 bytes>","Description":"\"Updated walkthrough showing complete image embeddings and rationalized syllabus audit.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\rajan\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\b78a5d36-6586-4c94-a487-70da0c9f5362\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough artifact\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
