{"step_index":123,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T16:09:37Z","content":"All matrices and determinants in both **Set A** and **Set B** (Question Papers and Marking Schemes) have been converted to **native Microsoft Word equation brackets (OMML)**:\n\n### What Has Been Implemented\n\n1. **Square Bracket Matrices $\\begin{bmatrix} \\dots \\end{bmatrix}$:**\n   - **$3 \\times 3$ Matrices** in **Q6** and **Q32** (and in Marking Schemes for $A, A^\\top, P, Q, \\text{adj}(A)$).\n   - **$2 \\times 2$ Matrices** in **Q22** (for $A, B$, and operations $2A - 3B$, $A + 2B$).\n   - **Column Vectors ($3 \\times 1$)** in **Q33** Marking Scheme (for $X = \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\\\ z \\end{bmatrix}$, $B$, and solution vectors).\n2. **Vertical Bar Determinants $\\begin{vmatrix} \\dots \\end{vmatrix}$:**\n   - **$3 \\times 3$ Determinants** in **Q28** (and in the marking schemes) with true vertical bars and matrix grids.\n3. **True Word Equation Objects:**\n   - Rendered using Word's native Office Math Markup Language (`<m:oMath>`, `<m:d>`, `<m:m>`, `<m:mr>`), so they resize dynamically and appear properly in print and on screen.\n\n---\n\n### Access the Updated Word Documents\n\nDirectory: `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\math_exam_2026\\`\n\n* **Set A Question Paper:** [Set_A_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.docx)\n* **Set A Marking Scheme:** [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx)\n* **Set B Question Paper:** [Set_B_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx)\n* **Set B Marking Scheme:** [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx)"}
