{"step_index":137,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T16:15:49Z","content":"### Why the Matrix Was Clipped & How It Has Been Fixed\n\nIn Microsoft Word, when a paragraph has a **fixed/exact line spacing** (such as `14 pt`), Word forces the line height to remain fixed at `14 pt`. Any multi-line inline mathematical equation taller than 14 pt (such as a $3 \\times 3$ matrix or determinant, which is ~40–50 pt tall) gets **vertically clipped**, showing only the middle row (3 numbers).\n\n### What Has Been Fixed:\n1. **Dynamic Line Height Expansion:**\n   - Changed the paragraph line spacing to **Single Spacing** (`line_spacing_rule = SINGLE`, with automatic height).\n   - Word now automatically expands the line height to fit all **3 rows (all 9 elements)** and the surrounding brackets $\\begin{bmatrix} \\dots \\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\begin{vmatrix} \\dots \\end{vmatrix}$.\n2. **Native OMML Word Equation Brackets:**\n   - **$3 \\times 3$ Matrices:** All 9 elements formatted inside native Word square brackets $[ \\dots ]$.\n   - **$2 \\times 2$ Matrices:** All 4 elements formatted inside native Word square brackets.\n   - **$3 \\times 3$ Determinants:** All 9 elements formatted inside native Word vertical bar brackets $| \\dots |$.\n   - **Column Vectors ($3 \\times 1$):** Formatted inside native Word brackets for $X = \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\\\ z \\end{bmatrix}$ and $B$.\n\n---\n\n### Access the Updated Word Documents\n\nDirectory: `C:\\Users\\rajan\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\math_exam_2026\\`\n\n* **Set A Question Paper:** [Set_A_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Question_Paper.docx)\n* **Set A Marking Scheme:** [Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_A_Marking_Scheme.docx)\n* **Set B Question Paper:** [Set_B_Question_Paper.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Question_Paper.docx)\n* **Set B Marking Scheme:** [Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx](file:///C:/Users/rajan/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/math_exam_2026/Set_B_Marking_Scheme.docx)"}
